## Tools Requiring Explicit User Instruction — Any Mode

Never call the following without the user explicitly requesting:

| Tool | Server | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| `ansible-auto-heal` | ansible-mcp | Automatically modifies live systems |
| `vault-rekey` | ansible-mcp | Destructive — rotates vault password |
| `ade_setup_environment` | ansible | Modifies dev environment packages |
| `define_and_build_execution_env` | ansible | Builds and pushes EE images |
| `create_ansible_projects` | ansible | Scaffolds project structure on disk |
| `project-bootstrap`, `register-project` | ansible-mcp | Modifies project registry |
| `create-playbook`, `create-role-structure` | ansible-mcp | Creates files on disk |
| `terraform` | sysoperator | Infrastructure changes, separate domain |
| `aws_*` (all 10 tools) | sysoperator | AWS infrastructure changes |
| All `browser_*` tools | cursor-ide-browser | Browser automation, separate domain |

